<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR STARTS AT $82-1/2 IN NEW YORK.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR STARTS AT $82-1/2 IN NEW YORK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADR opened up $4 at $82-1/2 in New York on Thursday but soon fell back to $82-1/4, up $3-3/4.</p>
<p>The latter price corresponded to about 444.9 markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235, news@reuters.fi</p>
